    "long_instructions": "## Explore AI Contributors\r\n\r\n#### **Do This:**\r\n\r\nChoose or locate your assigned AI contributor.\r\n\r\n1. Open your contributor’s profile.\r\n\r\n2. Read each section about their work and impact.\r\n\r\n3. Use the information to complete your AI Contributor Profile.\r\n\r\n4. Open the sources if you need more details.\r\n\r\nBe ready to explain how this person shaped AI history.",
